 former shopkeeper Ayame, a girl who remembers her past lives, and is watching her make mysterious items with great interest when a strange man appears.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d9fAhrUGjCswEDfV55djGSwXctS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15715","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"123779","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42822","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108952","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"391365","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"49773","synopsis":"Takaharu, a high school student whose fingertips have turned into chili peppers, comes to see Ramune. He seems to have some idea as to why he's haunted by the mysterious. The mysterious nail clippers Ramune lends to him can be removed from their bag once Takaharu stops hiding his true self. Initially Takaharu can't even untie the drawstring, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/80iF4OxneC6s5F65hz2y4uYapm8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Takaharu, a high school student whose fingertips have turned into chili peppers, comes to see Ramune. He seems to have some idea as to why he's haunted by the mysterious. The mysterious nail clippers Ramune lends to him can be removed from their bag once Takaharu stops hiding his true self. Initially Takaharu can't even untie the drawstring, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/80iF4OxneC6s5F65hz2y4uYapm8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15715","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"123779","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42822","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108952","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"391365","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"49845","synopsis":"A boy named Rio comes to the shrine. His mother is afflicted by a mysterious disease that has turned her ears into pot stickers. His mother claims not to know what the cause is, but she is distraught because they are preventing her not only from hearing the voices of others, but Rio's voice as well. Ramune explains that there are voices she can hear and voices she can't, and that it's an emotional problem. He decides to wait and see how her condition changes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dKZQj7Hv4OckEU3B52m8pgzKwcL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"A boy named Rio comes to the shrine. His mother is afflicted by a mysterious disease that has turned her ears into pot stickers. His mother claims not to know what the cause is, but she is distraught because they are preventing her not only from hearing the voices of others, but Rio's voice as well. Ramune explains that there are voices she can hear and voices she can't, and that it's an emotional problem. He decides to wait and see how her condition changes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dKZQj7Hv4OckEU3B52m8pgzKwcL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15715","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"123779","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42822","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108952","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"391365","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"49960","synopsis":"Rio learns that his mother's ears have turned into pot stickers because his older brother Yuu was kidnapped, and Rio feels responsible for what happened. When Rio nearly falls off a cliff while searching for Yuu, Ramune throws himself in harm's way to protect him and ends up badly injured. In order to save Ramune, Rio uses the Pearl of Night Voices he received from Ramune to treat his mother, desperately calling out to his mother, who can't hear his voice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tTOygpXwyryXswM7608UA7FcgLR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Rio learns that his mother's ears have turned into pot stickers because his older brother Yuu was kidnapped, and Rio feels responsible for what happened. When Rio nearly falls off a cliff while searching for Yuu, Ramune throws himself in harm's way to protect him and ends up badly injured. In order to save Ramune, Rio uses the Pearl of Night Voices he received from Ramune to treat his mother, desperately calling out to his mother, who can't hear his voice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tTOygpXwyryXswM7608UA7FcgLR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15715","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"123779","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42822","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108952","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"391365","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"50071","synopsis":"Kuro's classmate Aona is troubled by the popcorn that keeps popping out of his head. Aona says it makes him sad when the popcorn disappears, so Ramune lends him a bag that can be used to store the popcorn. Why is Aona's head producing popcorn, and why does he feel sad when it disappears? Ramune tells Aona that the treatment method will become clear if he asks himself those questions...","thumbna